{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1783122802048,"sessionID":"ses_0d59c9ad5ffeAYr66Cp2Upxq95","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"tool_tY8Gv1Mt56n1CWkxvmH1G7rD","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/yt/task/pc-lib-analysis/runs/pc-lib-3456/ncurses-snapshots/2026-07-03T23-40-02-009Z/blocks/function_summary.json","content":"{
  "summary": "ncurses 是 POSIX/Unix 系统上最广泛使用的字符终端 UI 库，提供与 System V curses 兼容的 API。它抽象了不同终端的能力差异，使 C/C++ 程序能够以可移植方式绘制窗口、处理键盘/鼠标输入、管理颜色和表单/菜单/面板等高级控件。库的核心依赖 terminfo/termcap 终端描述数据库，通过 POSIX termios/ioctl 与终端驱动交互；同时附带 tic、infocmp、tput、clear、tset 等命令行工具。",
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "终端字符界面绘制",
      "description": "提供 move、addch、addstr、box、hline、vline、refresh 等 API，在字符终端上绘制边框、线条、文本并刷新屏幕。",
      "evidence": ["ncurses/base/lib_addch.c", "ncurses/base/lib_box.c", "ncurses/base/lib_refresh.c", "ncurses/tty/tty_update.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "窗口与子窗口管理",
      "description": "管理 stdscr、子窗口、pad、覆盖层(overlay)的创建、移动、复制与销毁，并支持重叠窗口的刷新。",
      "evidence": ["ncurses/base/lib_newwin.c", "ncurses/base/lib_pad.c", "ncurses/base/lib_overlay.c", "panel/"]
    },
    {
      "name": "键盘与鼠标输入处理",
      "description": "读取键盘输入(getch/getstr)、支持功能键与自定义键绑定、处理鼠标事件及 raw/cbreak/echo 等输入模式。",
      "evidence": ["ncurses/base/lib_getch.c", "ncurses/base/lib_getstr.c", "ncurses/base/define_key.c", "ncurses/base/lib_mouse.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "颜色与视频属性控制",
      "description": "提供颜色对(pair)、前景/背景色、高亮、下划线、反显等属性的启用与组合，以及默认颜色假设。",
      "evidence": ["ncurses/base/lib_color.c", "ncurses/base/lib_chgat.c", "ncurses/base/lib_dft_fgbg.c"]
